to come up with, you know, significant reformulation efforts, but something that we're

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:09.880
certainly looking at. I would point out, even for medicines like Semblix, we're actively already

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:10.900
working on with the, you know, the, you know, the, you know, the, you know, the, you know, the, you

