know, the, you know, the, you know, the, you know, the, you know, the, you know, the, you know,

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:17.200
ways to hopefully extend that franchise even further. You know, with LifeBO, we move from

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:23.740
six months also to now go to 12 months and also to look at combinations of LifeBO to target other

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:30.340
siRNA targets within cardiovascular disease, things like HMG-CoA reductase amongst others.

